# v2.2.1.0, A Dropped Rule Id and Two Dead Paths Are Gone

Two checklists cited a rule id the style guide no longer carries, and the scripts README named two paths that did not resolve from its folder. Five documents are fixed. No check, guard or exit code changed.

> Spec folder: `specs/sk-code/hub-architecture/006-sk-code-audit-remediation`

&nbsp;

## What's New at a Glance

- **The JS and CSS style checklists name the rule.** Two files cited `CHK-CMT-07`. They now point to the history-comment rule in the code style guide.
- **`SKILL.md` says SKILLED system code.** The opening line called the tree by its old name.
- **The scripts README paths resolve.** The two guard paths start one level up, and the README reference check passes.
- **The playbook lists all nine test files.** The test table gains the two resolver tests.

